00:04:58,382 --> 00:05:00,228
So, what is Tanstack Start?

54
00:05:00,416 --> 00:05:05,776
Well, it's a full stack framework powered by Tanstack Router for React and Solid.

55
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:09,376
