138
00:11:33,038 --> 00:11:47,008
SSR, so full document SSR, streaming, server routes and API routes, server functions, these are type safe RPCs between client and server, which is very fancy and I will show you everything, don't worry.

139
00:11:47,168 --> 00:11:53,728
Middleware and context, full stack bundling, universal deployment, and end-to-end type safety.

140
00:11:53,888 --> 00:12:01,968
