00:29:17,264 --> 00:29:19,556
These are just dev tools and also scripts.

405
00:29:19,824 --> 00:29:20,932
What are these scripts?

406
00:29:21,104 --> 00:29:25,664
Well, if you go to the documentation and scroll a bit to the bottom, then you will see right here.

