00:29:29,424 --> 00:29:37,264
This is used to load all the client-side JavaScript for the application and should always be included for proper functionality.

409
00:29:37,518 --> 00:29:38,784
So that's very important.

410
00:29:38,990 --> 00:29:40,624
Don't delete the scripts.

411
00:29:40,846 --> 00:29:44,864
You need JavaScript, you hydrate everything and you make everything interactive.

412
00:29:45,104 --> 00:29:47,396
In a nutshell, this is the root layout.

413
00:29:47,584 --> 00:29:49,904
This is the entry point to your application.

414
00:29:50,126 --> 00:29:56,452
This makes a lot of sense to, for example, render your navbar or footer inside of here.

415
00:29:56,624 --> 00:29:57,664
