452
00:32:36,432 --> 00:32:46,116
You also have a lot of other pre-configured commands, for example, to build the application, to preview the application, to test the application, also a few Prisma commands.

453
00:32:46,432 --> 00:32:47,712
This is not very important.

454
00:32:47,918 --> 00:32:57,312
You will mainly just use the dev command to I guess start the development server, but also the build command to then later on build your application in production.

455
00:32:57,486 --> 00:32:59,312
But let's start our dev server.

456
00:32:59,502 --> 00:33:06,832
So to open your terminal, you can use the shortcut command J, or you can go to the top, click on terminal and then new terminal.

