00:33:06,992 --> 00:33:13,712
But I want to start my dev server, so pnpm rundev, and this will start your dev server on localhost 3000.

458
00:33:14,062 --> 00:33:18,592
So I will close this again, do a hard refresh, and this is our application.

459
00:33:18,830 --> 00:33:20,432
So let's analyze it quickly.

460
00:33:20,592 --> 00:33:23,472
On the top, we pretty much have like a navbar, right?

461
00:33:23,552 --> 00:33:23,952
A header.

462
00:33:24,032 --> 00:33:25,700
And then this is the main content.

463
00:33:25,902 --> 00:33:27,460
How is this structured?

464
00:33:27,694 --> 00:33:34,752
Well, if you again open the underscore root file, so right here, your root route, then you will find the header component.

465
00:33:34,912 --> 00:33:37,152
The header component is this nav bar.

466
00:33:37,392 --> 00:33:42,308
So they already created it for you, and this is exactly what you see at the top.

