00:33:59,726 --> 00:34:07,392
So if you again open the routes folder, this is the index file, and the index file holds all of the content for this index page.

473
00:34:07,472 --> 00:34:09,152
So with the title and so on.

474
00:34:09,312 --> 00:34:15,428
You can also verify it by copying this name, the framework for the next generation AI applications.

475
00:34:15,726 --> 00:34:18,752
And if you search for this right here, then you will find the result.

476
00:34:19,086 --> 00:34:25,124
So this index.tsx file directly compiles to the index route, if that makes sense.

477
00:34:25,472 --> 00:34:28,992
And to verify it even further, we can delete all of the content.

