1354
01:41:47,726 --> 01:41:50,320
So we currently have client side validation.

1355
01:41:50,542 --> 01:41:56,708
But the thing is you want to have the ability to both validate your data on the client side and server side.

1356
01:41:56,880 --> 01:41:59,600
And the most important thing is server side validation.

1357
01:41:59,760 --> 01:42:05,284
Client side validation is like an extra for the user to create a better user experience.

1358
01:42:05,520 --> 01:42:10,116
But the most important thing is to also validate the data on the server side.

1359
01:42:10,254 --> 01:42:15,520
And that's why you don't want to actually rely on these properties on your client side validation.

1360
01:42:15,726 --> 01:42:18,500
You want to always rely on server side validation.

1361
01:42:18,798 --> 01:42:22,720
