2674
03:21:12,656 --> 03:21:16,416
All code in Tanstack Start is isomorphic by default.

2675
03:21:16,576 --> 03:21:23,108
It runs and is included in both server and client bundles unless explicitly constrained.

2676
03:21:23,696 --> 03:21:25,696
Okay, this sounds interesting.

2677
03:21:25,870 --> 03:21:31,524
The code can run both on the client side and server side, or in other words, it does both.

2678
03:21:31,918 --> 03:21:38,416
So this code, format price, this is like just a helper function, runs both on the server and client side.

2679
03:21:38,574 --> 03:21:41,136
And route loaders are also isomorphic.

2680
03:21:41,296 --> 03:21:44,336
You currently don't know what route loaders are, but that's fine.

2681
03:21:44,590 --> 03:21:48,996
Essentially, they are there to fetch data and they are also isomorphic.

2682
03:21:49,358 --> 03:21:53,668
So before we dive into data fetching, let me reiterate it one more time.

2683
03:21:53,998 --> 03:22:00,016
So whenever you write code, this code here runs both on the server side and client side.

2684
03:22:00,176 --> 03:22:03,396
It can run both on the client side and server side.

2685
03:22:03,696 --> 03:22:09,604
When I, for example, do a hard refresh, this gets generated completely on the server side.

2686
03:22:09,838 --> 03:22:14,336
But if I do a client side navigation, then this is rendered on the client side.

2687
03:22:14,478 --> 03:22:16,656
This is CSR, client side rendering.

2688
03:22:16,976 --> 03:22:20,964
But if I again do a hard refresh, then this is server side rendered.

2689
03:22:21,216 --> 03:22:24,816
This is something that most people don't really understand or realize.

2690
03:22:24,896 --> 03:22:27,696
That's because most people don't read the documentation.

2691
03:22:27,856 --> 03:22:33,764
But again, if you do a hard refresh, everything gets generated on demand on the server side.

2692
03:22:33,966 --> 03:22:40,896
Whenever you do a client side navigation, this is rendered or the HTML is generated on the client side.

2693
03:22:41,056 --> 03:22:42,416
And this is very important.

2694
03:22:42,576 --> 03:22:52,292
This allows you to create fast applications while maintaining a great user experience and also while maintaining a good level of security.

