03:34:37,902 --> 03:34:42,532
A server function essentially is a standard function as you all know it.

2848
03:34:42,798 --> 03:34:49,284
But with the core difference that it always, like literally always, runs on the server side, no matter what.

2849
03:34:49,582 --> 03:34:55,108
But you can call it on the server side and client side or from the server side and client side.

2850
03:34:55,312 --> 03:34:58,756
But the code in the server function runs on the server side.

2851
03:34:58,992 --> 03:35:14,832
This is very similar to a server action in Next.js, with the core difference being that a server action in Next.js is there to mutate data, and a server function in TandStack Start is there to both fetch data and mutate data.

2852
03:35:14,992 --> 03:35:19,312
So if you are familiar with Next.js, then this will feel like second nature.

2853
03:35:19,392 --> 03:35:23,792
