2855
03:35:37,232 --> 03:35:44,112
And that's why you call these server functions also RPCs, because they can be called both from the server side and client side.

2856
03:35:44,334 --> 03:35:49,540
So an RPC is a remote procedure call, meaning it can be called from anywhere.

