3268
04:08:16,400 --> 04:08:19,520
So you still have to write all of the logic yourself.

3269
04:08:19,600 --> 04:08:29,604
And if meta, or in other words, if the creator of the website changes something, well then again you have to update the code, which means this is also high maintenance.

3270
04:08:30,000 --> 04:08:35,716
Therefore, we need some sort of better alternative, some sort of better solution that just works.

3271
04:08:36,160 --> 04:08:41,920
