04:28:58,414 --> 04:29:02,160
Most people validate their data on the client side, which is important.

3545
04:29:02,446 --> 04:29:06,560
But the server side is something that a lot of people skip, which is a big mistake.

3546
04:29:06,720 --> 04:29:11,120
