4266
05:19:52,432 --> 05:19:54,192
It depends on what you want it to do.

4267
05:19:54,352 --> 05:19:57,872
But in most cases, you want to redirect the user to slash login.

4268
05:19:58,062 --> 05:20:07,392
But if the user is authenticated, then the middleware will say, Okay, user, you are authenticated, you have the green light, I will forward the request to the server.

4269
05:20:07,566 --> 05:20:14,992
So just at the end of the day, imagine that this middleware is a layer in front of your server that intercepts every request.

4270
05:20:15,118 --> 05:20:20,752
So global middleware, it intercepts every request and then it does whatever you need it to do.

4271
05:20:20,992 --> 05:20:25,632
