7642
09:35:25,456 --> 09:35:30,496
Well, that's exactly where streaming data from server functions comes into play.

7643
09:35:30,798 --> 09:35:33,056
So as you already know, we covered streaming.

7644
09:35:33,230 --> 09:35:35,616
But we covered streaming when fetching data.

7645
09:35:35,982 --> 09:35:38,016
